#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# pause

#% text
# `pause(t)` waits `t` seconds.

#% section
# Details

#% item
# The value is `null`. An interrupt, or the limit of an enclosing `time_constrained`, ends the wait.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
pause(0.1)

#% cell
time_constrained(pause(5), 0.1, "stopped")
#% output
#= "stopped"

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `time_constrained`, `timing`
